#. module: esg
#: model_terms:knowledge.article,template_body:esg.esg_csrd_knowledge_article_template_csrd_governance
msgid ""
"The sustainability reporting process is governed by a risk management and\n"
"                        internal\n"
"                        control system designed to ensure the accuracy, "
"completeness, and\n"
"                        reliability of\n"
"                        sustainability data. It includes the identification "
"and assessment of\n"
"                        material\n"
"                        sustainability risks, the implementation of "
"appropriate mitigation measures,\n"
"                        and the\n"
"                        integration of findings into internal processes and "
"decision-making."
msgstr ""
"Le processus de reporting de durabilité est gouverné par un système de "
"gestion des risques et\n"
"                        de contrôle\n"
"                        interne conçu pour garantir l’exactitude, "
"l’exhaustivité et\n"
"                        la fiabilité des\n"
"                        données de durabilité. Il inclut l’identification et "
"l’évaluation des\n"
"                        risques matériels\n"
"                        de durabilité, la mise en œuvre de mesures "
"d’atténuation appropriées\n"
"                        et\n"
"                        l’intégration des conclusions dans les processus "
"internes et la prise de décision."

#. module: esg
