msgid ""
"The undertaking discloses <strong>quantitative and qualitative data</"
"strong>\n"
"                        that reflect performance against each material "
"sustainability matter\n"
"                        identified through the Double Materiality Assessment."
msgstr ""
"L’entreprise publie des <strong>données quantitatives et qualitatives</"
"strong>\n"
"                        qui reflètent la performance par rapport à chaque "
"question matérielle de durabilité\n"
"                        identifiée via l’analyse de double matérialité."

#. module: esg
#: model_terms:knowledge.article,template_body:esg.esg_csrd_knowledge_article_template_csrd_iro_management
msgid ""
"The undertaking has adopted policies to manage material sustainability\n"
"                        matters\n"
"                        identified through the Double Materiality Assessment."
msgstr ""
"L’entreprise a adopté des politiques pour gérer les questions matérielles de "
"durabilité\n"
"                        identifiées\n"
"                        via l’analyse de double matérialité."

#. module: esg
#: model_terms:knowledge.article,template_body:esg.esg_csrd_knowledge_article_template_csrd_iro_management
msgid ""
"The undertaking implements and monitors specific actions and allocates\n"
"                        resources to\n"
"                        manage each material sustainability matter."
msgstr ""
"L’entreprise met en œuvre et suit des actions spécifiques et alloue\n"
"                        des ressources pour\n"
"                        gérer chaque question matérielle de durabilité."

#. module: esg
#: model_terms:knowledge.article,template_body:esg.esg_csrd_knowledge_article_template_csrd_esrs_s1
msgid ""
"The undertaking maintains policies aligned with <strong>international\n"
"                                    labor\n"
"                                        standards, the EU Charter of "
"Fundamental Rights, and\n"
"                                        relevant national labor\n"
"                                        laws</strong>. These policies cover "
"all directly managed\n"
"                                    workers, including employees and non-"
"employee workers, ensuring\n"
"                                    fair treatment, safe working conditions, "
"and respect for\n"
"                                    fundamental labor rights."
msgstr ""
"L’entreprise maintient des politiques alignées avec les <strong>normes "
"internationales\n"
"                                    du travail,\n"
"                                        la Charte des droits fondamentaux de "
"l’UE et\n"
"                                        les lois nationales du travail\n"
"                                        pertinentes</strong>. Ces politiques "
"couvrent tous les travailleurs\n"
"                                    directement gérés, y compris les "
"employés et les travailleurs non employés, garantissant\n"
"                                    un traitement équitable, des conditions "
"de travail sûres et le respect des\n"
"                                    droits fondamentaux du travail."

#. module: esg
#: model_terms:knowledge.article,template_body:esg.esg_csrd_knowledge_article_template_vsm_b3
msgid ""
"The undertaking operates in <strong>[describe type of facilities and their "
"locations]</strong>, consisting of <strong>[specify owned/leased sites]</"
"strong>\n"
"                        and managed by <strong>[specify facility management "
"approach]</strong>. Due to the nature of its activities; <strong>[describe "
"activity type, e.g., consulting, services, manufacturing]</strong>,\n"
"                        certain environmental impacts such as <strong>[non-"
"relevant topics, if applicable]</strong> were not identified as significant."
msgstr ""
"L’entreprise opère dans <strong>[décrire le type d’installations et leurs "
"emplacements]</strong>, composées de <strong>[préciser les sites détenus/"
"loués]</strong>\n"
"                        et gérées par <strong>[préciser l’approche de "
"gestion des installations]</strong>. En raison de la nature de ses activités "
"; <strong>[décrire le type d’activité, p. ex., conseil, services, "
"fabrication]</strong>,\n"
"                        certains impacts environnementaux tels que <strong>"
"[sujets non pertinents, le cas échéant]</strong> n’ont pas été identifiés "
"comme significatifs."

